{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-07_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-07","title":"各取所需","storyCode":"4-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"08f96de963e4c9828386298623a144d49870d5aabb43e71d3301d761bd07c9d9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"为了攀爬个观测点，都要解决那么多整合运动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......是陈长官吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎么会有这么多尸体......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（这么多整合运动......全都是陈长官一个人打倒的吗？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我冲动了。抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能中了敌人的陷阱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不......没事，没有偏离计划太多，只是————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，出现的是......塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。无所谓了。应该是我的错觉，这里无论如何也不像有那个人在的状况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还是，要以任务优先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果不是我来带队，近卫局将很难开展搜查任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是现在的情况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"比我预想更复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"依照现状，独自深入的代价太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，罗德岛也希望你能够暂时返回近卫局队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这里毕竟是天灾残留的源石丛多生地段，对于健康人而言是很不利的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"事先准备的防护消耗品也不一定能维持很久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"保护龙门，优先清理龙门的威胁，当然是我们的任务——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但在我们来到这里的理由中，最重要的那个，是解救罗德岛的成员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛不会放弃任何一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，罗德岛的作战方针也不会改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我会带队与你们汇合——在条件允许的情况下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官！罗德岛可以让一支小队护送你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......陈长官，真要强呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......罗德岛又要孤军奋战了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在可不是垂头丧气的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，杰西卡她们还在等着我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]}]}
